<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Macedonian Arli Romani</book>
  <para style="h">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc1">O evangelije e Markoskoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt1">O Evangelije e Markoskoro</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">O Jovan Krstitel spreminela o drumo e Isuseske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Akava tano o početok taro evangelije e Devleskere Čhaveskoro, o Isus Hristos.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Sar soj pišimo ko prorok Isaija:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 1:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Akje, me bičhavava me glasniko angla tute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">so ka spreminel to drumo.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ov tano o glaso so vikinela ki pustina:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Spreminen o drumo e Gospodareskoro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Ramnonen o drumija leskere!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Hem agjar alo o Jovan Krstitel, so sine ki pustina. Ov propovedinela sine e manušenge deka trebela te iranen pe ko Devel hem te oven krstime, te šaj o Devel te oprostinel lengere grevija. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Togaš avena sine but manuša ki leste tari celo Judeja hem taro celo Erusalim. Ola priznajnena sine pumare grevija hem ov krstinela len sine ki reka Jordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />E Jovaneskere šeja sine kerde taro bala e kamilakere, a ki kičma sine phandlo kožno pojas, hem hala sine skakulcija hem divo avgjin.<verse eid="MRK 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ov propovedinela sine vakerindor: “Pala mande avela pobaro mandar, kaske so na sijum dostojno te tejlovav leskere sandale te phravav. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Me krstinava tumen pajneja, a ov ka krstinel tumen e Sveti Duhoja.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro krstiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ko adava vreme alo o Isus taro Nazaret ki Galileja hem o Jovan krstingja le ki reka Jordan. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Samo so iklilo o Isus taro pani, dikhla sar o nebo phravgjola hem sar o Sveti Duh hulela upro leste sar gulubi.<verse eid="MRK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Togaš šundilo glaso taro nebo: “Tu sijan mo manglo Čhavo so tute tani mi vojla.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro iskušenie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Odma palo adava o Duho e Devleskoro bičhalgja e Isuse ki pustina. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Hem adathe sine saranda dive iskušimo taro Beng. Sine maškar o diva životne, a o angejla služinena sine leske.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus počmingja te propovedinel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Palo adava koga o car Irod čhigja e Jovane ko zatvor, o Isus gelo ki Galileja hem propovedinela sine o evangelije e Devleskoro. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Hem vakerela sine:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:15">“Alo o vreme! Paše tano o carstvo e Devleskoro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:15">Pokajnen tumen hem verujnen ko evangelije!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e prvo učenikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Togaš o Isus dži kote nakhela sine taro Galilejsko ezero, dikhla e Simone hem leskere phrale e Andreja, sar frdena o mreže ko pani, soske ola sine ribajra.<verse eid="MRK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />I o Isus vakergja lenge: “Aven pala mande hem ka kerav tumen te astaren manušen mesto mačhen!”<verse eid="MRK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hem ola odma mukhle pumare mreže hem gele pala leste.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Koga gele adathar hari podur, o Isus dikhla e Zavedejeskere čhaven, e Jakove hem e Jovane, sar bešena sine ko pumaro čamco hem namestinena sine pumare mreže. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Odma o Isus vikingja len, hem ola mukhle pe dade e Zavedeje ko čamco zaedno sa e manušencar so kerena sine buti, hem gele palo Isus.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela demonen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Koga ale ko Kapernaum, ko prvo sabotno dive o Isus odma khugja ki sinagoga hem počmingja te sikavel e manušen. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ola čudinena pe sine taro leskoro učibe, soske ov sikavela len sine sar adava so isi le vlast, a na sar o učitejla e Zakoneskere.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Ama ki sinagoga sine jekh manuš, so sine opsednimo lošno duhoja, hem počmingja te vikinel: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“So mangeja tu amendar, Isuse taro Nazaret? Alan li te uništine amen? Džanava koj sijan tu: Tu sijan o Svetco e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Ama o Isus zaptingja le vakerindor: “Phan to muj! Iklov lestar!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Koga o Isus vakergja adava, o lošno duho silno tresingja e manuše hem vikaja iklilo lestar.<verse eid="MRK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />A sa o manuša so sine andre čudisalile hem počminge maškar peste te pučen pe: “Soj akava! Savo tano akava nevo učibe vlasteja! E lošno duhonge zapovedinela, hem ola da šunena le!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Hem odma šundilo baši o Isus ki celo Galileja.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela bute manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Samo so iklile tari sinagoga, o Isus e Jakoveja hem e Jovaneja ale ko kher e Simoneskoro hem e Andrejaskoro. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />A andre sine pašli i sasuj e Simoneskiri so sine la bari treska, i odma adava vakerge e Isuseske. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Togaš o Isus alo uza late, astargja lakoro vas hem vazdingja la. Hem i treska odma mukhla la, i oj služingja lenge.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Paloručko, koga pelo o kham, sa o manuša taro Kapernaum anena sine ko Isus e nasvalen hem e manušen so sine len demojna. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />A anglo udar khedisalili bari gužva taro celo gradi. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Hem o Isus sasljargja bute manušen, so sine nasvale taro razno nasvalipe. Ikalgja bute demonen, hem na dozvolingja lenge te keren lafi, soske ola džange koj tano ov.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus propovedinela ki celo Galileja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Tajsutno dive, rano sabajle o Isus uštilo, iklilo taro kher hem gelo ko jekh mirno than hem adathe molingja pe.<verse eid="MRK 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />A o Simon hem okola so sine leja, iklile te roden le. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />I koga arakhle le, vakerge leske: “Sarinen rodena tut!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Ajde te dža ko najpašutne gava hem adathe te propovedinav, soske me adaleske alum.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Hem ov džala sine ki celo Galileja hem propovedinela sine ko lengere sinagoge hem ikalela sine demonen.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela leprozno manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Jekh manuš, so sine nasvalo tari lepra, alo anglo Isus, pelo ko kočaka hem silno molingja le: “Te manglan tu, šaj te sasljare man!”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />E Isuseske pelo doborom žal, pružingja po vas, pipingja le hem vakergja: “Mangava! Saslov!”<verse eid="MRK 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Samo so phengja adava o Isus, i lepra taro manuš našavdili, hem ov saslilo.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Pred te mukhel le o Isus, zapovedingja leske: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Ma vaker nikaske akava! Samo dža hem sikav e sveštenikoske deka sijan sasto, hem de žrtva baši to očistiba, sar so o Mojsej naredingja, te šaj te ovel svedoštvo lenge.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ama o manuš, samo so iklilo adathar, počmingja sarinenge te vakerel so ulo leja, i o Isus našti sine više te khuvel javno ko gradi, samo ačhola sine ko čuče thana. A palem o manuša avena sine ki leste taro sa o strane.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus isi le vlast te oprostinel grevija hem te sasljarel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Palo nekozom dive, o Isus palem alo ko Kapernaum hem šundilo deka tano ko jekh kher. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />I adathe khedisalili bari gužva, agjar so na sine više than, ni andre ni taro udara te nakhel pe. A ov propovedinela sine o lafi e Devleskoro.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Togaš sine štar džene so mangle te anen anglo Isus jekhe sakate manuše. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Pa koga dikhle deka našti avena anglo Isus taro narodo, phrage o krovi e khereskoro hem mukhle e sakate pe postelaja anglo Isus.<verse eid="MRK 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Koga o Isus dikhla lengiri vera, vakergja e sakateske: “Mo čhavo, oprostime tane te grevija!”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />A adathe sine nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere so korkori pes pučle: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Sar šaj akava te vakerel agjar? Koj šaj te oprostinel o grevija, osven o Devel? Ov hulinela!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />O Isus odma pe duhoja svatingja so ola mislinena, hem pučlja len: “Soske agjar mislinena ko tumare srcija? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Soj polokhe te vakerel pe akale sakateske: ‘Oprostime tane te grevija’ ili te vakerav leske: ‘Ušti, le ti postela hem dža tuke?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Ama ka dokažinav tumenge deka o Čhavo Manušeskoro isi le vlast ki phuv te oprostinel grevija” – i vakergja e sakateske: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Tuke vakerava: Ušti! Le ti postela hem dža khere!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />I ov uštilo odma, lela pi postela hem iklilo avrik anglo sarinen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">I agjar sarine čudisalile hem počminge te slavinen e Devle vakerindor: “Asavko nešto nikat na dikhlem!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e Levija hem hala e grešnikoncar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />O Isus palem gelo uza ko ezero, i sa o manuša avena sine ki leste hem ov sikavela len sine. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Dži kote phirela sine o Isus dikhla e Levija o čhavo e Alfejeskoro, sar bešela sine ko than kote so khedela pe danok. I odma vakergja leske: “Ava pala mande!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:14">Ov uštilo hem gelo pala leste.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />A koga bešla o Isus pe učenikoncar te hal ko kher e Levijaskoro, lencar bešle but danočnikija hem grešnikija, asavke sine but džene so džana sine palo Isus.<verse eid="MRK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Koga o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere dikhle e Isuse sar hala e grešnikoncar hem e danočnikoncar, pučle leskere učenikon: “Soske tumaro učiteli hala hem pijela e grešnikoncar hem e danočnikoncar?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Koga šungja o Isus adava, odgovoringja lenge: “E sastenge na trebela doktori, nego e nasvalenge. Me na alum e pravednikon te vikinav, nego e grešnikon.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse pučena bašo posti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />E Jovane Krstiteleskere učenikija hem o fariseja postinena sine. Nesave manuša ale ko Isus hem pučle le: “Soske e Jovaneskere hem e farisejengere učenikija postinena, a te učenikija na postinena?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Sar šaj te postinen o henamika koga o džamutro tano lencar? Sa dži kote o džamutro tano lencar, ola našti te postinen. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ama ka avel dive, koga ka ovel lelo o džamutro lendar, i togaš ko adava dive ola da ka postinen.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Nikoj na sivela nevi krpa ko purano gad, soske ko thojbe ka otkačingjovel o nevo taro purano, hem o otvor ka ovel pobaro. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Nikoj na čhorela nevi mol ko purane mevija;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mevija </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mevovi sine kerde tari životnengiri koža kote so koristinena sine sar fučija. </char></note> soske o nevo mol ka phajlakerel o mevija hem i mol ka čhorgol. Nego o nevo mol čhivela pe ko neve mevija.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus Gospodari e sabotakoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ko jekh sabotno dive o Isus pe učenikoncar nakhle maškar o nive, i počminge leskere učenikija te phagen klasija giv.<verse eid="MRK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />A o fariseja pučle le: “Soske te učenikija kerena akava ko sabotno dive, koga nane dozvolimo taro Zakoni?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Nikat li na čitingjen so o David kergja, koga sine bokhale ov hem o manuša so sine leja? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Khugja ko kher e Devleskoro, ko vreme koga sine o baro svešteniko o Avijatar, hala o maro so sine posvetimo, so nasminela sine nikoj te hal le osven o sveštenikija. I o David dengja okolenge da so sine leja.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />I togaš odgovoringja lenge: “I sabota tani kerdi e manušeske, a na o manuš e sabotake. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Agjar o Čhavo Manušeskoro tano Gospodari e sabotakoro.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela ki sabota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />I khugja palem o Isus ki sinagoga, a adathe sine manuš so leskoro vas sine šuko hem našti sine te koristinel le. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Adathe sine manuša so adžikerena sine te dikhen dali o Isus ka sasljarel e manuše ki sabota, te šaj te tužinen le.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Togaš o Isus vakergja e manušeske so sine leskoro vas šuko: “Ava hem tergjov maškaral!” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />I pučlja len: “Soj dozvolimo te kerel pe ki sabota: šukaripe ili lošnipe? Te spasinel pe životo ili te mudarel pe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">A ola kjutinena sine.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />I o Isus dikhla len holamo, hem sine leske but pharo bašo lengere barale vile. Hem phengja e manušeske: “Pružin to vas!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:5">Ov pružingja po vas hem leskoro vas saslilo.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Togaš o fariseja iklile hem odma khedinge pe e Irodeskere manušencar te dogovorinen pe sar te mudaren e Isuse.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">But manuša avena te dikhen e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />O Isus cidingja pe učenikoncar adathar hem gelo ko Galilejskoro ezero, a pali leste džana sine but narodo tari Galileja hem tari Judeja, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />taro Erusalim, taro Idumeja, taro javer strana tari reka Jordan hem taro thana Tir hem Sidon. Sa adala manuša ale ko Isus, soske šunge deka kerela sine but čudija.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Koga o Isus dikhla adaja gužva, vakergja pe učenikonge te spreminen leske o čamco te šaj o narodo te na gurinen pe upro leste. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Soske adava dive sasljargja bute manušen hem avena sine nasvale, so mangena sine te pipinen le, te šaj te oven saste. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Koga dikhena le sine o lošna duhija, so sine ko manuša, perena sine ko kočaka hem vikinena sine: “Tu sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />A ov silno opomeninela len sine te na vakeren nikaske koj tano ov.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus birinela dešuduj apostojla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Palo adava o Isus gelo ki gora hem vikingja adalen so mangla, hem ola ale ki leste. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Togaš o Isus biringja dešuduje manušen so vikingja len apostojla, te oven leja hem te bičhavel len te propovedinen <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />hem te ovel len avtoriteti te ikalen e demonen. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />A akala tane o anava e dešudujengere so sine birime:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">o Simon, (so o Isus dengja le o anav Petar),<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />o čhave e Zavedejeskere,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:17">o Jovan hem o Jakov, so dengja len anav Voanerges, (so značinela “Čhave e gromeskere”),<verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />o Andrej,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Filip,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Vartelomej,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Matej,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Jakov, o čhavo e Alfejeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Tadej,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">o Simon Kananiec<verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />hem o Juda Iskariot, so ka predajnel e Isuse.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Veelzevul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Togaš o Isus gelo khere hem palem adathe khedisalili bari gužva, adaleja so o Isus hem leskere učenikija našti sine te han. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Koga šunge i familija e Isuseskiri bašo adava, ale te len le hem te legaren le, soske ola mislinge deka dilisalilo.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />A o učitejla e Zakoneskere ale taro Erusalim hem vakerge: “O Veelzevul, o gospodari e demonengoro tano leste andre! Leskere silaja ikalela e demonen.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />O Isus vikingja len uza peste hem počmingja te vakerel lenge ko parabole: “Sar šaj o Beng te ikalel e Benge? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ako isi carstvo, so jekh jekheja marena pe, adava carstvo našti te ačhol. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ili kher kote so nane sloga, adava kher našti te ačhol. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ako o Beng uštilo protiv peste hem odvisalilo, ov ka našti te ačhol, ama alo leskoro krajo. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Nikoj našti te čorel taro kher, kote so bešela zoralo manuš, sa dži kote na phandela le. Togaš koga ka phandel le, ka šaj te čorel taro kher.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Čače vakerava tumenge: e manušenge šaj te oven oprostime sa o grevija hem o hule so hulinena. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />A koj hulinela upro Sveti Duh nikat nane te ovel leske oprostimo, hem adava ka ovel leske večno grevo.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Ov phengja adava soske phenge deka ov sine opsednimo lošno duhoja.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj e Isuseskiri familija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Togaš e Isuseskiri daj hem o phrajla leskere ale adathe. Dži kote adžikerena sine avrijal bičhalge nekas te vikinen le.<verse eid="MRK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />A uza leste bešena sine but manuša hem vakerge leske: “Avrik ti daj hem te phrajla adžikerena te dikhen tut.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />A o Isus pučlja len: “Koj tani mi daj hem me phrajla?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Koga dikhla e manušen, so bešena sine uza leste, vakergja: “Akje, akala tane mi daj hem me phrajla. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Soske, sekoj so kerela i vojla e Devleskiri, ov tano mo phral, mi phen hem mi daj.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sejači</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />O Isus počmingja palem te sikavel e narodon uza ko ezero Galilejsko. I uklilo ko čamco hem bešla adathe, adaleske so bari gužva khedisalili uza leste. O manuša so bešena sine ko kopno, šunena sine so vakerela o Isus. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />I but bukja sikavela len sine ko parabole.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:2">Jekh taro adala parabole sine akaja: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Šunen! Akje, iklilo jekh sejači te sejnel. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Dži kote o sejači sejnela sine, nesavo seme pelo lestar ko drumo, i ale o čirikla hem sa hale o seme. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Javer seme pelo lestar ko than kote so sine hari phuv, a poviše bara, i odma počminge te iklon, soske na sine ki hor phuv. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Ama koga iklilo o kham te tharel, ola thabile hem šukile, adaleske so na sine len korenja. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />A nesavo seme pelo maškar o kare hem koga barile o kare zagušinge le hem ov na dengja plodi. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />A nesavo seme pelo lestar ki šukar phuv, i počminge te iklon, barile hem denge šukar plodija: Jekh trijanda puti poviše, dujto šovardeš puti poviše, trito šel puti poviše.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />I vakergja lenge: “Kas isi kana neka šunel!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soske o Isus vakerela ko parabole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />A koga ačhilo o Isus korkori pe učenikoncar hem okola so sine leja, pučle le baši akaja parabola.<verse eid="MRK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />I ov vakergja lenge: “Tumenge i dendo te džanen i tajna taro carstvo e Devleskoro. A okola soj avrik, sa ko parabole ka vakerel pe lenge, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />soske:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 4:12" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Jakhencar ka dikhen, a nane te dikhen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">kanencar ka šunen, ama nane te svatinen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Soske ako svatinge ka iranen pe ko Devel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">hem ka oven oprostime lengere grevija.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa 6:9-10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus objasninela i parabola bašo sejači</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />O Isus pučlja len: “Doborom li na svatingjen akaja parabola? Togaš sar ka svatinen javera parabole?<verse eid="MRK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />O sejači tano adava so sejnela o lafi e Devleskoro. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />O sejmo seme soj tano ko drumo tane okola manuša, so šunena o lafi e Devleskoro, i odma avela o Beng hem čorola lendar adava, soj sejmo ki lende. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />A o seme soj sejmo ko poviše bara a pohari phuv, tane okola manuša so šunge o lafi e Devleskoro i odma priminge le so radost. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ama adaleske so nane len korenja ki lende, samo so avena o problemija hem o progoniba bašo lafi e Devleskoro, odma perena tari vera. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />O seme soj sejmo ko kare tane okola manuša, so šunge o lafi e Devleskoro, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ama o sekiracije akale životoskere, o hovavno barvalipe hem javera želbe ki lende zagušinena o lafi e Devleskoro, hem ola našti te den plodi. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />A o sejmo seme ki šukar phuv tane okola manuša, so šunena o lafi e Devleskoro, prifatinena le hem anena šukar plodija: Jekh trijanda puti poviše, dujto šovardeš puti poviše, a trito šel puti poviše.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši svetlina e momojlakiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />A togaš o Isus pučlja len: “Koj tumendar koga tharena momoli učarela la čareja, ili čhivela la telo kreveti? Na čhivena li i momoli ko lakoro than te svetinel? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Adaleske sa soj tajno ka iklol javno, hem sa soj garavdo ka dikhol. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Kas isi kana, neka šunen šukar!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Hem vakergja lenge: “Šunen šukar: Save merkaja ka merinen, asavke merkaja ka merinel pe, hem ka del pe tumenge panda poviše. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Soske, kas so isi le, leske ka del pe; a kas nane, lestar ka lel pe adava da so isi le!”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo seme so bajrola korkori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />O Isus vakergja lenge: “O carstvo e Devleskoro ličinela sar jekh manuš so frdingja o seme ki phuv, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />i sovela, uštela dive rat, a adale vremeske iklola hem bajrola o seme, a o manuš na džanela sar bajrola. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />I phuv korkori pestar dela plodija, prvo čar, klasija hem palo adava avela pherdo giv. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />A koga avela o vreme te reslon o plodija, o manuš avela, čhinela len hem khedela len.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sinapovo zrno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Palem o Isus vakergja lenge: “Soleja te sporedinav o carstvo e Devleskoro ili save parabolaja te vakerav le? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Adava tano sar jekh sinapovo zrno soj tano najtikno seme taro sa o semija so sejnela pe. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />A koga sadinela pe, iklola hem ovela najbaro žbuni taro rastenija, mukhela bare granke, kerela senka hem o čirikla kerena gnezdo ki leste.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />O Isus ko but asavke parabole phenela lenge sine o lafi e Devleskoro, kozom so šaj te svatinen. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />I bizo parabole na vakerela sine ništo e manušenge, a koga sine korkori pe učenikoncar lenge objasninela sine sa.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus smirinela i bura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ko adava dive rakjate, o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Ajde, te dža okoja strana taro ezero.”<verse eid="MRK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Koga mukhle e narodo, o učenikija uklile ko čamco kote so sine o Isus, hem počminge te džan, a pala lende džana sine javera da čamcija.<verse eid="MRK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Hem taro jekh puti ko ezero astargja bari bura. I počminge silna talasija te khuven ko čamco, adaleja so o čamco počmingja te phergjol pani. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />A ko adava momenti o Isus sine pašlo ko jastuko hem hor zasuto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:38">A o učenikija koga dikhle deka sovela, uštarge le hem vakerge leske: “Učitele, nane li tuke pharo so ka mera?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />O Isus uštilo, zapovedingja e bavlalake te ačhol, hem phengja e ezeroske: “Smirin tut!” I bavlal ačhili hem uli bari tišina.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />I o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Soske doborom darana? Panda li nane tumen vera?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ola but darandile hem pučle pe maškar peste: “Koj tano akava so i bavlal da hem o talasija da šunena le?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela lošna duhija taro manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />O Isus hem leskere učenikija nakhle taro Galilejsko ezero ki Gadarinsko phuv. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Samo so iklilo o Isus taro čamco, alo angli leste jekh manuš taro grobija so sine opsednimo lošno duhoja. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Akava manuš živinela sine ko grobija, i nikoj više našti sine te phandel le lanconcar. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />But puti phandena sine leskere vasta hem leskere pre lisicencar hem lanconcar, ama ov čhinela sine o lancija hem o lisice taro vasta phagela len sine. Nikoj na sine doborom silno te smirinel le. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Dive rat sine ko grobija hem ko ridija, pištinela sine hem khuvela pe sine korkori pes barencar.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Koga dikhla e Isuse duraldan prastandilo ki leste hem pelo ko kočaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Hem sa pe glasoja vikingja: “Isuse, Čhavo e Najbare Devleskoro, so mangeja mandar? Dava tut sovli upro Devel, ma mučin man!”<verse eid="MRK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />(Adaleske so o Isus više zapovedingja e lošno duhoske te iklol taro manuš.)<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Togaš o Isus pučlja le: “Sar vikineja tut?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Ov odgovoringja leske: “Legija vikinena man, soske but sijem ki leste.”<verse eid="MRK 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />I but molingja e Isuse te na brkinel len taro adava than.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Adathe ko rido sine but bale, so hana sine. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />A o lošna duhija molinge e Isuse vakerindor: “Bičhal amen ko bale te khuva!”<verse eid="MRK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />I o Isus mukhla len. O lošna duhija iklile taro manuš hem khuge ko bale. Celo stado taro duj ilade bale prastandile taro brego, pele ko ezero hem adathe taslile.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />A adala manuša, so arakhena sine e balen, našle hem širinge ko celo gradi hem ko gava so dikhle, agjar sa o manuša iklile te dikhen so ulo. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Koga ale ko Isus, dikhle e manuše so sine le Legija lošna duhija, sar bešela uravdo hem sasto vesto e Isuseja, hem ola darandile. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />A adala so dikhle adava vakerena sine so ulo e manušeja hem e balencar. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Togaš o manuša molinge e Isuse te džal peske taro lengoro than.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Koga o Isus uklilo ko čamco, adava manuš so sine le lošna duhija, molingja le te džal leja. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />A o Isus na mukhla le te džal pala leste, ama phengja leske: “Dža khere hem vaker tumarenge so o Gospodari kergja tuke hem kozom milost sikavgja tuke.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ov gelo ko Dekapolis hem počmingja te vakerel sa so kergja leske o Isus. I sekoj so šunela sine adava čudinela pe sine.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vazdela e čhaja taro meribe hem sasljarela e nasvale romna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />O Isus palem nakhla e čamcoja tari okoja strana taro ezero hem uza leste khedisalili bari gužva, a ov sine uzo ezero. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Togaš alo ko Isus o Jair, jekh taro vodačija e sinagogakere hem pelo ko kočaka anglo leskere pre. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />I silno molingja le: “Mi čhaj i meribaja jekh! Ava čhiv te vasta upro late te sasljol hem te živinel!”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />I o Isus gelo leja. A but manuša džana sine pala leste hem gurinena pe sine upro leste.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Maškar lende sine jekh nasvali romni, so dešuduj berš thavdela sine latar rat. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />But cidingja ko doktojra, sa pe pare trošingja mislindor deka ka ovel lake pošukar, a pološno uli. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Koga šungja e Isuseske, nakhla maškar o manuša hem palaldan pipingja leskere šeja. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Adaleske so akaja romni phengja ki peste: “Samo te pipinav man ko leskere šeja, me ka sasljovav.” <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />I odma o rat čhinagja te thavdel latar, a oj osetingja pe deka saslili.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />O Isus odma osetingja deka iklili lestar bari sila, i irangja pe ko manuša hem pučlja: “Koj pipingja me šeja?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />A o učenikija leskere vakerge leske: “Dikheja li kozom manuša gurinena pe upro tute, a tu pučeja: ‘Koj pipingja man?’”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ama o Isus rodela sine te dikhel koj kergja adava. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Togaš adaja romni tresinela sine tari dar, soske džangja so ulo laja. Ali, peli ko kočaka hem vakergja leske sa.<verse eid="MRK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />O Isus vakergja lake: “Mi čhaj, ti vera sasljargja tut! Dža tuke mireja hem ov sasljardi taro to nasvalipa!”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Dži kote kerela sine lafi o Isus, ale nesave manuša taro kher e Jaireskoro so sine vodači e sinagogakoro hem vakerge leske: “Ti čhaj muli. Soske dosadineja više e učitele?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Koga šungja adava o Isus, vakergja e Jaireske: “Ma dara! Samo verujn!”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />I o Isus nikas na mukhla te džan pala leste, samo e Petareske, hem e duje phralenge o Jakov hem o Jovan.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Koga ale dži ko kher e Jairesko, o Isus dikhla bute manušen, sar rovena hem vikinena sa pe glasoja. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Khugja andre hem vakergja: “Soske rovena hem vikinena? I čhaj na muli, oj sovela!” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />A ola asandile leske.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">I o Isus zapovedingja sarinenge te iklon avrik, samo te ačhoven andre o dad hem i daj e čhajakiri hem leskere trin učenikija so ale pala leste. Hem khugja adathe kote so sine i čhaj pašli.<verse eid="MRK 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ov astargja o vas e čhajakoro hem vakergja lake: “Talita, kumi!” (So značinela: “Čhaje, tuke vakerava, ušti!”).<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />I čhaj odma uštili hem počmingja te phirel, hem sarine čudisalile. A la sine la dešuduj berš. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Togaš o Isus zapovedingja lenge te na vakeren nikaske hem phengja lenge te den la te hal.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus nane prifatimo ko Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />O Isus iklilo adathar pe učenikoncar hem alo ko than kaj so barilo. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Koga ali i sabota, ov počmingja te sikavel ki sinagoga, i but džene šunena sine hem čudinena pe sine ko leskoro učibe. Hem vakerena sine: “Kotar leske sa akava? Hem savi tani akaja mudrost, soj leske dendi? Sar šaj te kerel asavke čudija pe vastencar? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Nane li akava o stolari, o čhavo e Marijakoro, o phral e Jakoveskoro, e Josijaskoro, e Judaskoro hem e Simoneskoro? Hem nane li akate maškar amende o phenja leskere?” Togaš nerviringe pe hem na mangle te prifatinen le.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />O Isus phengja lenge: “E proroko ko sa o thana poštojnena le, samo ko than kote so barilo, maškar leskiri familija hem leskoro kher, na poštojnena le.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Adathe na kergja but čudija, samo čhigja pe vasta nesave nasvalenge hem sasljargja len. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />I čudisalilo so na sine len vera.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Hem počmingja te džal ko gava hem te sikavel e manušen.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela pe dešuduje učenikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Togaš o Isus vikingja e dešuduje učenikon, hem počmingja te bičhavel len duj po duj, hem dengja len avtoriteti upro lošno duhija. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Ov zapovedingja lenge te na len ništo peja ko drumo – ni maro, ni torbe, ni pare – samo jekh kaš phiribaske, <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />a te uraven pe ko sandale hem te na len peja javer gad.<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Hem phengja lenge: “Ako khugjen ko nesavo kher hem priminge tumen, ačhoven adale khereste, sa dži kote na džana tumenge taro adava than. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Ako negde na priminge tumen ili na mangle te šunen tumen, ikloven adathar hem tresinen i prašina taro tumare pre sar znako deka nane tumen ništo lencar.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Hem o učenikija gele hem propovedinena sine bašo pokajanie. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Ikavena sine bute demonen hem makhle bute nasvalen ujleja, hem ola saslile.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O meriba e Jovane Krstiteleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />I o car Irod šungja bašo Isus, adaleske so leskoro anav sine prešundo. Nesave manuša vakerena sine: “Ov tano o Jovan Krstitel. Uštilo taro mule hem adaleske šaj kerela asavke čudija.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Javera vakerena sine: “Ov tano o Ilija.” A javera vakerge: “Ov tano proroko, sar o javera prorokija so sine ko purano vreme.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Koga o Irod šungja adava, vakergja: “Adava tano o Jovan, kaskoro šero čhingjum le me. Ov uštilo taro mule!”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Soske korkori o Irod angleder bičhalgja te astaren e Jovane hem te frden le ko zatvor. A adava kergja baši i Irodijada, i romni leskere phraleskiri e Filipeskiri, so o Irod lela la romnake. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Soske o Jovan Kristitel phenela sine e Irodeske: “Nane tuke dozvolimo te le romnake te phraleskere romna.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />I Irodijada doborom zamrzingja e Jovane, hem mangla te mudarel le. Ama našti kerela sine adava, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />soske o Irod darala sine taro Jovan, adaleske so džanela sine deka tano pravedno hem sveto manuš, hem arakhela le sine. Koga o Irod šunela sine e Jovane ov sine bunimo, ama ov palem mangela sine te šunel le.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Konečno, peli šuži šanca e Irodijake. A adava dive sine o rodenden e Irodeskoro, koga ov spremingja hajbe pijbe, vikingja sa e manušen so sine generajla vojskakere hem bare manuša tari Galileja. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Togaš ali angli lende e Irodijadakiri čhaj hem khelela sine. Adava sine but šukar e Irodeske hem leskere gostenge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">I o Irod phengja e čhajake: “Rode mandar sa so mangeja, hem me ka dav tut.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Hala lake sovli hem phengja: “Sa so mangeja, ka dav tut! Ako trebno ka dav tut ekvaš taro mo carstvo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Oj iklili avrik hem pučlja pe daja: “So te rodav?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">A oj odgovoringja lake: “O šero e Jovane Krstiteleskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />I čhaj odma khugja hem phengja e Irodeske: “Mangava odma akana te de man ko čaro o šero e Jovane Krstiteleskoro!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />E Irodeske sine but žal, ama na mangla te iranel i sovli so dengja la anglo gostija. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />I odma naredingja e dželateske te džal hem te anel o šero e Jovaneskoro. Ov gelo, čhingja leskoro šero ko zatvor <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />hem angja le ko čaro i dengja le e čhajake, a oj dengja le pe dajake.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Koga šunge adava o učenikija e Jovaneskere, ale hem lele leskoro telo hem čhige le ko grobo.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus parvarela pandž ilade manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />O apostojla irange pe ko Isus hem vakerge leske sa so kerge, hem sa so sikavge e manušen.<verse eid="MRK 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />A e Isuse hem e učenikon na sine len vreme te han maro, soske but manuša avena sine hem džana. Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “Aven ka dža ko nesavo mirno than korkori hem adathe ka odmorina amen.”<verse eid="MRK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />I ola lele o čamco te džan ko jekh čučo than. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />A but džene dikhle len sar džana hem pendžarge len, hem taro sa o gradija prastandile te resen angleder lende ko adava than. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Koga o Isus iklilo taro čamco, dikhla bute manušen hem alo leske but pharo baši lenge, soske ola sine sar bakhre bizo pastiri. I počmingja but bukja te sikavel len.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />I koga sine kasno, ale leskere učenikija hem phenge leske: “Kasno i više a ko akava than nane ništo. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mukh e manušen te džan ko najpaše gava hem thana te šaj kinena peske maro.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />O Isus phengja lenge: “Den len tumen nešto hajbaske!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Ola pučle le: “Kotar? Amenge trebela pare so dena pe jekhe beršeske te šaj te kina maro sa akale manušenge!”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />A ov pučlja len: “Kozom mare isi tumen? Džan hem dikhen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Koga dikhle, vakerge: “Pandž mare hem duj mačhe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Togaš o Isus vakergja sarinenge te bešen ko grupe tele ki zeleno čar. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Hem bešle ko grupe po šel hem po pinda džene.<verse eid="MRK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Ov lela o pandž mare hem o duj mačhe, dikhla upre ko nebo, hem blagodaringja bašo hajbe. Phagla o mare hem dengja pe učenikonge te delinen e manušencar, hem isto agjar ov delingja sarinenge adala duj mačhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />I sarinen hale hem čalile. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Sa adava so ačhilo, khedinge, hem ačhilo len panda dešuduj korpe maro hem mačhe. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />A adala so hale sine pandž ilade murša (bizo te gejnen pe o romna hem o čhave).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus phirela upro pani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Odma palo adava o Isus phengja pe učenikonge te uklen ko čamco hem angleder lestar te džan ki okoja strana taro ezero ki Vitsaida, dži kote ov bičhavela e manušen pe kherende. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Koga ispratingja len, gelo upre ki gora te molinel pe.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Koga rakjilo avrik, o čamco ačhilo maškar ko ezero, a o Isus sine ki kopno. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Hem dikhla e učenikon sar phareste veslinena o čamco, soske prema lende phudela sine i bavlal. A sine paše maškar o trin dži ko šov o sati sabajle. Togaš ov alo ki lende phirindor upro pani hem haričkake ka nakhel sine uza lende, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ama ola, koga dikhle le sar phirela upro pani, počminge te vikinen, soske mislinge deka tano duho. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Sarinen dikhle le hem uklingja len bari dar. A o Isus odma phengja lenge: “Oven silna! Ma daran! Me sijum.”<verse eid="MRK 6:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Togaš khugja ko čamco hem i bavlal ačhili. A ola but čudinge pe taro sa akava, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />adaleske so ola na svatinge o čudo so ulo e marencar, soske lengere vile sine but barale.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e nasvalen ko Genisaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Koga o Isus nakhla pe učenikoncar ki okoja strana taro ezero, resle ki phuv Genisaretsko hem adathe phanle o čamco. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Samo so iklile taro čamco, o manuša odma pendžarge e Isuse. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Hem sarinen prastandile te vakeren javerenge deka alo o Isus, i počminge te legaren sa e nasvalen anglo Isus. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Hem kaj so khuvela sine o Isus ko gava, gradija ili mahale, anena sine sa e nasvalen ko ploštadija hem molinena sine e Isuse samo te mukhel len te pipinen pe ko krajo taro leskere šeja. Hem sarinen so pipinena pe sine leske ko šeja, sasljona sine.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">E Devleskere zapovedija hem o manušikane adetija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Uza ko Isus khedisalile le o fariseja hem nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere, so ale taro Erusalim. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />I dikhle nesave taro leskere učenikija, sar hana maro bi thovde vastencar – so značinela deka tane melale. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Adaleske so o fariseja hem sa o Evreja ikerena sine o adetija e phurengere, adaleja so na hana maro dži kote na thovena pe vasta šukar. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Hem koga iranena pe sine khere taro pazari, dži kote na thovena šukar pe vasta na hana sine maro, hem sine panda but adetija so ikerena: thojba čaše, bukajla hem čare.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Adaleske o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere pučle e Isuse: “Soske te učenikija hana maro melale vastencar, a na ikerena pe ko adetija amare phurengere?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Šukar prorokujngja o prorok Isaija bašo tumaro dujmujalipe, sar soj pišimo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 7:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Akala manuša samo pe mujeja poštojnena man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">a pe srceja dur tane mandar.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Džabe poštojnena man;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">sikavindor manušikane adetija.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Tumen e Devleskere zapovedija mukhena, a ikerena o manušikane adetija.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Hem vakergja lenge: “Tumen ko asavko lošno način mangena te čhinaven o zapovedija e Devleskere, te šaj ikerena tumare adetija! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Soske o Mojsej phengja: ‘Poštojn te dade hem te daja’ hem, ‘Koj ka del armanja pe dade hem pe daja, te ovel kaznimo meribaja.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />A tumen vakerena deka o manuš šaj te phenel pe dadeske ili pe dajake: ‘Sa soleja šaj sine te pomožinav tut ko životo, više halum sovli deka ka dav le e Devleske sar korbani (so značinela poklon e Devleske).’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Agjar na mukhena leske ništo soleja šaj te pomožinel pe dade ili pe daja. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Sikavindor javeren tumare adetija, čhinavena o lafi e Devleskoro. Hem isi panda but bukja asavke so kerena.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela so mejlarela e manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />O Isus palem vikingja sa e narodo ki peste hem vakergja lenge: “Šunen man sarine hem svatinen akava: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ništo avrijaldan, so khuvela andre ko manuš, našti te kerel le melalo, nego adava so iklola andral taro manuš, adava kerela le melalo. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Kas isi kana neka šunel!]”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Koga cidisalilo e narodostar, khugja ko jekh kher hem o učenikija pučle le baši akaja parabola.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />I o Isus pučlja len: “Tumen da li na svatingjen? Na svatingjen li deka ništo avrijaldan, so khuvela andre ko manuš našti te kerel le melalo? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Soske adava na khuvela ko srce, nego ko vogi, hem palo adava iklola taro leskoro telo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:19">(Agjar sa o hajbe o Isus proglasingja deka tano čisto.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Hem panda vakergja lenge: “Adava, so iklola andral taro manuš, adava kerela e manuše melalo. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Soske andral, taro srce e manušeskoro, iklona o lošna misle, o bludstvo, o čoriba, o mudariba, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />i preljuba, alčnost, lošnipe, ljubomora, hovajbe, o huliba, gordost, faliba, dilinipe. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Sa akava lošnipe, so iklola andral taro manuš, mejlarela le.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I vera jekhe romnakiri so nane Evrejka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Palo adava o Isus gelo tari Galileja ko thana taro Tir. Khugja ko jekh kher hem na mangla nikoj te džanel deka tano adathe, ama našti sine te garavel pe. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Soske šungja leske jekh romni, so lakiri čhaj sine la lošno duho, oj ali hem peli ko kočaka anglo leskere pre. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Adaja romni sine Grkinka, bijami ki Sirisko Fenikija. I molingja e Isuse te ikalel e demone tari lakiri čhaj.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />O Isus phengja lake: “Mukh prvo te han o čhave hem te čajloven, adaleske so nane šukar te le pe lendar o maro hem te frdel pe e džukelenge.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />A oj odgovoringja leske: “Oja, Gospode! Ama o džukela da hana o troške telo astali so perena taro čhave.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Togaš o Isus phengja lake: “Bašo akava lafi so vakergjan mange, šaj te dža khere. O demoni iklilo te čhajatar.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Koga oj irangja pe khere, arakhla pe čhaja sar pašlola sine ki postela, a o demoni više iklilo latar.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela jekhe manuše soj kašuko hem laloro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />I palem o Isus iklilo taro Tir gelo ko Sidon hem palo adava gelo ko Galilejsko ezero, hem ko thana taro Dekapolis. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Nesave manuša ange ko Isus jekhe manuše, so sine kašuko hem phareste kerela sine lafi, i molinge le te čhivel po vas upro leste.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />O Isus koga cidingja le ki jekh strana podur taro manuša hem čhigja pe naja ko leskere kana. Togaš čhungargja ko pe naja hem pipingja leskiri čhib. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Palo adava o Isus dikhla upre ko nebo, hor izdišingja hem vakergja leske: “Effata!” (So značinela: “Phravgjov!”).<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Odma phravdile leskere kana hem leskiri čhib, i počmingja šukar te kerel lafi.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />I o Isus zapovedingja e manušenge nikaske te na vakeren bašo akava. Ama kozom zapovedinela sine lenge te na vakeren, ola poviše vakerena sine. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />A o manuša but čudinena pe sine hem vakerena: “Sa šukar kerela – dži o kašuke te šunen hem o lalore te keren lafi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus parvarela štar ilade manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ko adala dive palem khedisalili bari gužva. I adaleske so na sine len so te han, o Isus vikingja pe učenikon uza peste hem phengja lenge: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Pharo mange akale manušenge. Trin dive tane mancar, a nane len so te han. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ako mukhlum len te džan peske bokhale khere, ka peren ko drumo, soske nesave lendar ale duraldan.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />A o učenikija pučle le: “Kaj šaj te arakha ko akava čučo than dovolno maro bašo sa akala manuša te čajloven?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />O Isus pučlja len: “Kozom mare isi tumen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Ola phenge: “Efta.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Togaš vakergja e manušenge te bešen tele ki phuv, lela o efta mare, blagodaringja e marenge, phagla len, hem dengja pe učenikonge, a ola delinge len e manušenge. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Hem isto agjar sine len nekozom tikne mačhe. O Isus blagodaringja lenge da, hem phengja e učenikonge len da te delinen. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Sarinen hale hem čalile. Hem khedinge efta korpe taro adava so ačhilo. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Adala so hale sine štar ilade manuša. Palo adava o Isus mukhla len te džan peske. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Hem odma uklilo ko čamco pe učenikoncar hem gelo ko thana tari Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O fariseja rodena znako taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Togaš ale o fariseja hem počmingja te akošen pe e Isuseja. Iskušinge le adaleja so rodinge lestar znako taro nebo.<verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />A ov silno izdišingja hem vakergja: “Soske akaja generacija rodela mandar znako? Čače phenava tumenge: Nisavo znako nane te del pe lenge.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Togaš mukhla len, uklilo palem ko čamco, hem nakhla tari javer strana taro ezero.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O kvasaci e farisejengoro hem e Irodeskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />A o učenikija leskere bisterge te len peja o maro, osven so sine len samo jekh maro ko čamco.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />A o Isus opomeningja len: “Pazinen! Arakhen tumen taro kvasaci e farisejengoro hem taro kvasaci e Irodeskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />A ola kerena sine lafi maškar peste: “Akava phengja amenge soske nane amen maro!”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />O Isus džangja so kerena lafi hem pučlja len: “Soske kerena akava lafi deka nane tumen maro? Panda li na svatinena hem na dikhena? Doborom li barale tumare vile? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Jakha isi tumen, a na dikhena? Kana isi tumen, ama na šunena? Hem na setinena tumen li? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Koga phagljum o pandž mare e pandže ilade muršenge, kozom pherde korpe khedingjen adalestar so ačhilo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Ola phenge: “Dešuduj.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“A koga phagljum o efta mare e štare ilade manušenge, kozom pherde korpe khedingjen adalestar so ačhilo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Ola phenge: “Efta.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Hem ov pučlja len: “Panda li na svatingjen?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela korole manuše ki Vitsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Koga resle ki Vitsaida, nesave manuša ange ko Isus jekhe korole manuše hem molinge le te čhivel pe vasta upro leste. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />O Isus astargja e korole manuše taro vas hem ikalgja le avrik taro gav, i čhungargja leske ko jakha hem čhigja pe vasta upro leste.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:23">I pučlja le: “Dikheja li nešto?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ov počmingja te dikhel hem vakergja: “Dikhava e manušen. Dikhona sar te phene kašta phirena.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Panda jekh puti o Isus čhigja pe vasta leskere jakhende, hem o manuš phragja pe jakha, irangja pe leske o dikhibe hem dikhela sine sa šukar.<verse eid="MRK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Togaš o Isus bičhalgja le khere hem phengja leske: “Ma khuv ko gav.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar phenela deka o Isus tano o Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />O Isus pe učenikoncar gele ko gava uza e Filipeskiri Cezarija. Drumaldan o Isus pučlja len: “So phenena o manuša, koj sijum me?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Ola odgovoringe leske: “Nekoj phenela o Jovan Krstitel, a javera phenena deka sijan o prorok Ilija, a nesave javera phenena deka tu sijan jekh taro prorokija.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Togaš o Isus pučlja len: “A tumen? So phenena, koj sijum me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">O Petar odgovoringja leske: “Tu sijan o Hristos!”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />I o Isus zapovedingja lenge nikaske te na vakeren baši leske.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />I počmingja te sikavel len deka o Čhavo Manušeskoro trebela but te cidel, hem nane te ovel prifatimo taro starešine, taro prvosveštenikija hem taro učitejla e Zakoneskere, hem ka ovel mudardo. Ama o trito dive ka uštel taro mule. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />O Isus phengja lenge adava otvoreno. Ama o Petar cidingja le ki jekh strana, hem opomeningja le.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ama koga o Isus irangja pe hem dikhla pe učenikon, vikingja e Petareske hem vakergja: “Naš mandar, Benga! Soske na mislineja adava soj Devleskoro, nego manušeskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sar te ovel pe Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Togaš vikingja sa e narodo uza peste zaedno pe učenikoncar, hem phengja lenge: “Koj mangela te ovel mo učeniko, neka otkažinel pe pestar hem neka lel po krsto hem neka phirel pala mande. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Soske koj mangela te spasinel po životo, ka našavel le, a koj mangela te našavel po životo baši mange hem bašo evangelije, ka spasinel pe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />So džabe celo sveto te le, ako ti duša našagjan? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ili soleja o manuš šaj zameninela pi duša?<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Soske koj ladžala mandar hem me lafendar ki akaja neverno hem grešno generacija, o Čhavo Manušeskoro da ka ladžal lendar, koga ka avel ki slava pe Dadeske e sveto angelencar.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />O Isus phengja lenge: “Čače vakerava tumenge, isi nesave maškar tumende so nane te meren, sa dži kote na dikhena o carstvo e Devleskoro sar avela pe silaja!”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pi slava pe trine učenikonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />A palo šov dive, o Isus lela peja e Petare e Jakove hem e Jovane hem gele ki uči gora, kote so ola sine korkori. Adathe angli lende e Isuseskoro izgled promenisalilo. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Leskere šeja ule doborom parne, so našti sine nijekh manuš ki akaja phuv agjar te parnarel len! <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Hem adathe pojavisalile angli lende o Ilija hem o Mojsej, so kerena sine lafi e Isuseja.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Togaš o Petar phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, šukar amenge so sijem akate. Ajde te kera trin šatojra – jekh tuke, jekh e Mojsijaske, hem jekh e Ilijaske.”<verse eid="MRK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />(O Petar tari dar na džangja so te phenel, soske ola but darandile.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Togaš alo jekh oblako hem učhargja len, i šundilo glaso taro oblako: “Akava tano mo manglo Čhavo. Le šunen!”<verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />I taro jekh puti, koga dikhle uza peste na dikhle više nikas, osven e Isuse.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Koga hulena sine tari gora, o Isus zapovedingja lenge nikaske te na vakeren so dikhle, sa dži kote o Čhavo Manušeskoro na uštela taro mule. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ola nikaske na vakerge adava, ama pučle pe maškar peste, so značinela akava: “Te uštel taro mule.”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />A o učenikija pučle le: “Soske o učitejla e Zakoneskere vakerena deka prvo trebela te avel o Ilija?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Čače o Ilija ka avel prvo hem ka sredinel sa. Togaš soske i pišimo deka o Čhavo Manušeskoro mora but te cidel hem te ovel otfrlimo? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Ama vakerava tumenge: Sar soj pišimo lestar, o Ilija više alo hem kerge leske sar ola so mangle.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela e čhavestar o lošno duho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Koga o Isus irangja pe e trine učenikoncar ko okola učenikija, dikhle bute manušen uza lende hem nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere sar akošena pe lencar. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Sarine samo so dikhle e Isuse, iznenadinge pe hem prastandile te pozdravinen pe leja.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />I o Isus pučlja len: “Soske akošena tumen lencar?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Jekh taro manuša odgovoringja leske: “Učitele, angjum ki tute me čhave, so ki leste isi lošno duho so na mukhela le te kerel lafi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Hem stalno, koga i te astarel le, peravela le ki phuv hem o čhavo ikalela pena taro muj, steginela pe danda hem kočingjola. I rodingjem te učenikondar te ikalen le, ama ola našti sine te keren adava.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />O Isus odgovoringja: “O, bez verno generacijo, dži koga ka ovav tumencar? Dži koga ka trpinav tumen? Anen e čhave ki mande!”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Hem ange le ki leste, i samo so dikhla o duho e Isuse, odma počmingja te frdel e čhave ko sa o strane. Ov pelo tele ki phuv hem počmingja te prakinel hem te ikalel pena taro muj.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />O Isus pučlja leskere dade: “Kozom vreme ov tano asavko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">O dad odgovoringja: “Taro tiknipe. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />But puti frdela le sine ki jag hem ko pani, te šaj te mudarel le. Ama ako šaj te kere nešto, žalin amen hem pomožin amen!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />O Isus phengja leske: “Ako šaj? Sa šaj okoleske koj so verujnela!”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Odma e čhaveskoro dad vikingja: “Verujnava! Pomožin man te verujnav poviše.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Koga o Isus dikhla deka but manuša prastana ki lende te dikhen so ka ovel, zapovedingja e lošno duhoske: “Duho laloreja hem kašukeja, zapovedinava tuke, iklov lestar hem nikat ma iran tut ki leste!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />O lošno duho vikingja, hem silno tresingja e čhave hem iklilo lestar. A o čhavo sine pružimo ki phuv sar mulo, a but džene phenge deka mulo. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ama o Isus astargja le taro vas, vazdingja le hem o čhavo uštilo ko pre.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Koga o Isus khugja ko jekh kher, o učenikija leskere koga sine leja korkori, pučle le: “Soske amen našti sine te ikala le?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Ov phengja lenge: “Asavko duho ništoja našti te ikalel pe, samo molitvaja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">molitvaja </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nesave rakopisija dodajnena: hem posteja. </char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus dujto puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Koga iklile adathar, nakhle tari Galileja. A o Isus na mangla nikoj te džanel kaj tane ola, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />soske ov sikavela sine samo pe učenikon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:31">Hem vakergja lenge: “O Čhavo Manušeskoro, ka ovel predajmo ko vasta e manušenge hem ka mudaren le, a palo trin dive ka uštel taro mule.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />A ola na svatinge so vakergja lenge, a darana sine te pučen le.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj tano najbaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Palo adava o Isus hem leskere učenikija ale ko Kapernaum, hem koga resle ko kher, o Isus pučlja len: “Baši so akošlen tumen drumaldan?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ama ola kjutinena sine, soske ko drumo akošle pe maškar peste koj tano najbaro.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />O Isus bešla, vikingja e dešudujen učenikon, hem phengja lenge: “Koj mangela te ovel prvo, mora te ovel posledno sarinendar hem te ovel sluga sarinenge!”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Togaš angja jekhe čhave maškar lende, lela le ki angali, hem phengja lenge: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Koj priminela jekh taro akala čhave ko mo anav, priminela man, a koj priminela man, na priminela samo man, nego priminela okole so bičhalgja man.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj nane protiv amende, ov tano amencar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />O Jovan phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, dikhlem nesave manuše sar ikalela demonen ko to anav hem amen na mukhlem le te kerel adava, soske ov na džala amencar pala tute.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />A o Isus phengja leske: “Mukhen le te kerel adava, soske nikoj so kerela čudija ko mo anav, našti odma te vakerel lošno mandar. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Soske koj nane protiv amende ov tano amencar. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Čače vakerava tumenge, sekoj so ka del tumen čaša pani ko mo anav, soske sijen e Hristoskere, nane te našavel pi nagrada.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela sar te na pera ko grevo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Ako nekoj čhivela jekhe taro akala tikne čhave so verujnena ki mande te perel ko grevo, pošukar leske te phandel pe baro bar ki men hem te ovel frdimo ko more. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Hem ako to vas čhivela tut ko grevo, čhin le. Pošukar te khuve jekhe vasteja ko večno životo, nego te oven tut o solduj vasta hem te dža ko pekol, ki jag so nikat na ačhola, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[kote o kirme nikat na merena hem i jag nikat na ačhola]. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />To pro ako čhivela tut ko grevo, čhin le. Pošukar i te khuve bango ko večno životo, nego te oven tut o solduj pre, a te ove frdimo ko pekol, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[kote o kirme nikat na merena hem i jag nikat na ačhola]. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ili ako ti jakh čhivela tut ko grevo, ikav la. Pošukar i te khuve ko carstvo e Devleskoro jekhe jakhaja, nego te oven tut o solduj jakha, a te ove frdimo ko pekol, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />kote o kirme so hana len nikat na merena hem i jag nikat na ačhola. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Adaleske sarine ka čistinen pe jagaja, sar i žrtva so čistinela pe loneja.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />O lon i šukar, ama ako o lon našagja po vkus, soleja ka iranel pe leskoro vkus? Neka ovel tumen lon ki tumende, hem neka ovel tumen mir maškar tumende.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bašo brako hem o razvod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />O Isus iklilo taro Kapernaum hem gelo ko thana tari Judeja hem tari javer strana tari reka Jordan. I palem ali bari gužva ki leste, hem počmingja palem te sikavel len, sar sekat so kerela sine.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />I ale uza leste o fariseja te iskušinen le hem pučle le: “Dozvolimo li o rom te mukhel pe romna?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />A ov pučlja len: “Savi naredba dengja tumen o Mojsej?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Ola vakerge: “O Mojsej dozvolingja e manušeske te del pe romnake razvodno lil hem te mukhel la.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />O Isus phengja lenge: “O Mojsej pišingja tumenge adaja naredba adaleske so sijen inačije. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ama ko početok, koga o Devel kergja sa, ‘ov kergja len murš hem džuvli.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Adaleske o manuš ka mukhel pe dade hem pe daja, hem ka ovel jekh pe romnaja, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />hem ola duj ka oven jekh telo.’ Agjar ola nane više duj, nego jekh telo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Adaleske, o Devel so phandla, o manuš ma te odvinel.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Koga ale palem ko kher, o učenikija pučle le bašo adava. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />I o Isus vakergja lenge: “Koj ka mukhel pe romna hem ka lel javera romnake, ov kerela preljuba upro late. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ili i romni ako mukhla pe rome hem lela javere romeske, oj da kerela preljuba.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus blagoslovinela e tikne čhaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />O manuša anena sine pumare čhaven anglo Isus te čhivel pe vasta upro lende, ama o učenikija zaptinge len.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Koga o Isus dikhla adava, holangja hem phengja lenge: “Mukhen e čhaven te aven ki mande hem ma zaptinen len, soske asavkjenge pripadinela o carstvo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Čače phenava tumenge, koj na priminela o carstvo e Devleskoro sar tikno čhavo, nikat nane te khuvel ki leste.”<verse eid="MRK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Togaš lela e čhaven ki angali, čhigja pe vasta upro lende hem blagoslovingja len.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o barvalo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Koga o Isus iklilo ko drumo, prastandilo ki leste jekh manuš, pelo ko kočaka angli leste hem pučlja le:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:17">“Šukar učitele, so trebela te kerav te šaj te dobinav o večno životo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />A o Isus phengja leske: “Soske vakereja mange deka sijum šukar? Nikoj nane šukar osven jekh Devel. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />O zapovedija džaneja: ‘Ma mudar, ma ker preljuba, ma čor, ma svedočin hovajbe, ma hovav, poštojn te dade hem te daja.’”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />A o manuš phengja leske: “Učitele, sa adava pazingjum taro mo tiknipe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />O Isus dikhla le, i zamangla le hem phengja leske: “Panda jekh falinela tuke. Dža, bikin sa so isi tut hem delin e čorolenge, i ka ovel tut barvalipe upre ko nebo. Togaš ava hem phir pala mande.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Koga šungja adava o manuš, razočaringe pe hem gelo peske, soske sine le baro barvalipe.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />O Isus dikhla pe učenikon hem vakergja lenge: “Kozom i pharo e barvalenge te khuven ko carstvo e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />A o učenikija čudinge pe taro leskere lafija.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:24">O Isus palem phengja lenge: “Me čhave, kozom i pharo te khuvel pe ko carstvo e Devleskoro! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Polokhe ka ovel e kamilake te nakhel maškar o kan e suvijakoro, nego e barvaleske te khuvel ko carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />O učenikija poviše čudinge pe hem počminge maškar peste te pučen pe: “Togaš koj šaj te ovel spasimo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />O Isus dikhla len hem vakergja lenge: “Akava i nešto so o manuša našti te keren, ama o Devel šaj. O Devel šaj kerela sa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Togaš o Petar phengja leske: “Akje, amen mukhlem sa hem alem pala tute.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />A o Isus phengja: “Čače phenava tumenge, sekoj so ka mukhel po kher, pe phralen, pe phejnen, pe daja, pe dade, pe čhaven ili pe nive bašo mange hem bašo evangelije, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ka dobinel šel puti poviše ko akava vreme: khera, phrajla, phenja, daja, čhaven hem o nive – uza ko sa adava ka ovel progonimo da – a o vreme so avela ka dobinel večno životo. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Ama but džene soj akana prva ka oven posledna, a o posledna ka oven prva.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus trito puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />A dži kote džana sine ko Erusalim, o Isus džala sine angli lende, a o učenikija leskere čudinena pe sine, a o manuša so džana sine pala lende, uklingja len dar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:32">Togaš o Isus cidingja ki strana e dešuduje učenikon hem počmingja te vakerel lenge so ka ovel leja: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />“Akje džaja upre ko Erusalim hem adathe o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo e prvosveštenikonge hem e učitelenge e Zakoneskere, hem ola ka osudinen le ko meribe, hem ka predajnen le e manušenge so nane Evreja. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Ka asan leske, ka čhungaren le, ka kamšikujnen le hem ka mudaren le, ama palo trin dive ka uštel taro mule.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pučibe e Jakoveskoro hem e Jovaneskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Togaš ale uza ko Isus o Jakov hem o Jovan, e Zavedejeskere čhave, hem vakerge leske: “Učitele, mangaja te kere amenge sa so ka roda tutar.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Ov pučlja len: “So mangena te kerav tumenge?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Ola odgovoringe: “Mukh amen, koga ka ove ki ti slava, te beša jekh tari ti desno strana, a jekh tari ti levo strana.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />O Isus phengja lenge: “Na džanena so rodena. Šaj li te pijen tari čaša kotar me so pijava, ili te oven krstime, krstibaja soleja me sijum krstimo?” <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />A ola odgovoringe leske: “Šaj.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Togaš o Isus phengja lenge “Oja, ka pijen tari čaša koja me pijava hem ka oven krstime, krstibaja soleja me sijum krstimo, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />ama nane mlo te vakerav koj ka bešel tari mi desno hem tari mi levo strana. Adala thana ka del pe okolenge kaske soj spremime.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Koga šunge adava o javera deš učenikija, holange e Jakoveske hem e Jovaneske.<verse eid="MRK 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />A o Isus vikingja sarinen hem phengja lenge: “Džanena deka okola so računinena pe sar vladitejla e narodongere, vladinena upro lende silaja, hem lengere da bare manuša vladinena upro lende. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ama akava ma te ovel maškar tumende, a koj mangela te ovel baro maškar tumende, neka ovel tumenge sluga, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />hem koj mangela te ovel prvo maškar tumende, neka ovel robo sarinenge. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro na alo te služinen leske, nego ov te služinel hem te del po životo sar otkup butenge.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e korole Vartimeje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />I agjar ale ko Erihon. Koga o Isus pe učenikoncar hem bute manušencar iklola sine taro Erihon, ko drumo bešela sine jekh korolo manuš so rodela peske sine pare. Leskoro anav sine Vartimej (so značinela “čhavo e Timejeskoro”). <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Koga šungja deka nakhela o Isus taro Nazaret, vikingja: “Isuse, Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema mande!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />But džene zaptinena le sine te na vikinel, ama ov poviše vikinela sine: “Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema mande!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />O Isus ačhilo hem vakergja: “Vikinen le.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">I ola vikinge e korole hem vakerge leske: “Ma dara! Ušti, o Isus vikinela tut!”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />O Vartimej frdingja po mantili, uštingja ko pre hem alo anglo Isus.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />I o Isus pučlja le: “So mangeja te kerav tuke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">O korolo manuš vakergja: “Učitele, mangava te dikhav.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />A o Isus phengja leske: “Dža tuke, ti vera sasljargja tut.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">O manuš odma dikhla hem počmingja te džal palo Isus.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus khuvela ko Erusalim sar caro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Koga o Isus hem leskere učenikija ale paše uza ko Erusalim, ki Vitfagija hem ki Vitanija, ki Maslinovo Gora, o Isus bičhalgja pe duje učenikon, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />vakerindor: “Džan ko akava gav, soj angli tumende. Samo so ka khuven ki leste, ka arakhen terno her soj phandlo, so panda nijekh manuš na uklilo ki leste. Phraven le hem anen le akate. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />I te pučlja tumen nekoj: ‘Soske kerena akava?’ vakeren, ‘E Gospodareske trebela hem odma ka iranel le palal.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Ola gele i arakhle e terne here avrijal ki ulica, phandlo ki porta. Dži kote phravena le sine, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />nesave manuša so bešena sine adathe vakerge lenge: “So kerena, soske phravena le?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Ola vakerge lenge sar so phengja lenge o Isus hem o manuša mukhle len. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Koga ange e terne here ko Isus, čhige pe šeja upro her, hem o Isus bešla upro leste.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />But džene bujlarena sine pe šeja tele ko drumo, a nesave manuša zelena granke listoncar, so čhinge len taro nive. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />A okola so džana sine angli leste, hem pali leste, vikinena sine:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 11:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“‘Osana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Blagoslovimo okova so avela ko anav e Gospodareskoro!’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Ps 118:25-26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“‘Blagoslovimo tano o carstvo amare dadeskoro e Davideskoro, so avela!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:10">Osana ko učipe!’”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Koga o Isus alo ko Erusalim, khugja ko dvoro taro Hrami, dikhla sa adathe, ama sine više kasno, iklilo hem gelo e dešuduje učenikoncar ki Vitanija.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus prokletinela i smokva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />O tajsutno dive, koga iklilo tari Vitanija, o Isus bokhalilo. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />A duraldan dikhla jekh smokva, so sine učhardi listoncar, hem alo te dikhel dali isi la plodija. Koga alo uza late, dikhla deka nane la ništo samo listija, soske na sine o vreme bašo smokve.<verse eid="MRK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Togaš phengja e kašteske: “Nikoj te na hal više taro to plodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">A leskere učenikija šunge so phengja adava.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus čistinela o Hrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Koga resla ko Erusalim, o Isus khugja ko dvoro taro Hrami hem počmingja te brkinel adalen so kinena sine hem so bikinena. Irangja o astajla adalengere so meninena sine pare hem o tezge so bikinena sine gulubija, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />hem na mukhela sine nikas te anel roba ko dvoro e Hrameskoro.<verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Hem sikavela len sine, vakerindor: “Nane li pišimo ko Sveto Lil: ‘Mo kher ka vikinel pe kher molitvake bašo sa o narodija?’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>.</char></note> A tumen kergjen le than kote so khedena pe o čora!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Ere 7:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />O prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere koga šunge adava, počminge te roden sar te mudaren le, adaleske so darana sine lestar, soske o narodo sine iznenadime taro leskoro učibe.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Koga rakjilo, o Isus hem leskere učenikija ikilile taro gradi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I lekcija e smokvakiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Tajsutno dive, dži kote nakhena sine, dikhle i smokva so šukili taro koreno.<verse eid="MRK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />O Petar setingja pe hem phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, dikh! I smokva, so prokletingja la, šukili!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Neka ovel tumen vera ko Devel. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Čače, vakerava tumenge ako nekoj vakergja akale planinake: ‘Ušti hem frde tut ko more,’ hem na sumningja pe ko po srce, hem verujnela deka ka ovel adava so phengja, ka ovel čače kerdo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Adaleske vakerava tumenge, sa so ka roden ki molitva, verujnen deka primingjen adava hem ka ovel tumaro adava. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Koga tergjovena ki molitva, oprostinen te isi tumen nešto protiv nekaste, te šaj tumaro Dad soj ko nebo te oprostinel tumare grevija.”<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[“Ama ako tumen na oprostingjen, ni tumaro Dad soj ko nebo nane te oprostinel tumare grevija.”]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro avtoriteti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Ola palem ale ko Erusalim, a koga o Isus phirela sine ko dvoro taro Hrami, ale ki leste o prvosveštenikija, o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o starešine. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Hem pučle le: “Kotar tuke akava avtoriteti te kere akala bukja? Koj dengja tut pravo te kere akava?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Ka pučav tumen me da nešto, hem odgovorinen mange. I me da ka vakerav tumenge kotar mange pravo te kerav sa akava. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Kotar e Jovaneske avtoriteti te krstinel – taro Devel ili taro manuš? Odgovorinen mange!”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />A ola kerena sine lafi maškar peste: “Ako vakergjem: ‘Taro Devel,’ ka vakerel, ‘Soske na verujngjen le?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ama ako vakergjem: ‘Taro manuš’…?” (Ola darana sine taro manuša, soske sarine mislinena sine deka o Jovan tano čače proroko).<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />I odgovoringe e Isuseske: “Na džanaja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">A o Isus phengja lenge: “Me da na phenava tumenge kotar mange pravo te kerav sa akava.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo lošna lozajra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Togaš o Isus počmingja te vakerel ko parabole: “Jekh manuš sadingja drakha hem čhigja ograda, randla dupka hem kergja than kote so šaj kerela pe i mol, hem kergja kula te šaj pazinena i drakh. Togaš dengja le ki kirija nesave lozarenge hem gelo peske. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />I koga alo vreme te kheden i drakh, bičhalgja pe sluga ko lozajra te lel jekh delo. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ama o lozajra astarge, marge le hem bičhalge le palal čuče vastencar. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Ov bičhalgja javere sluga ki lende, a ola pharage leskoro šero hem ladžakerge le. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Ov bičhalgja panda jekhe sluga ama le da mudarge. Bičhalgja panda but džene, a o lozajra jekhen marge a javeren mudarge.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Ačhilo le panda jekhe te bičhavel, pe mangle čhave, ki krajka le da bičhalgja hem vakergja: ‘Ka poštojnen me čhave.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ama o lozajra vakerge maškar peste: ‘Akavaj o nasledniko. Ajde te mudara le hem sa o nasledstvo ka ačhol amenge.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Astarge, mudarge le hem frdinge le avrik taro adava than. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />So ka kerel o gazda e drakhakoro? Ka avel, ka mudarel e lozaren hem ka del i drakh javerenge.<verse eid="MRK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Na čitingjen li akava ko Sveto Lil:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘O bar so sine frdimo taro zidajra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">adava bar ulo najvažno bar e khereskoro.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Adava kergja le o Gospodari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">hem buti šužo anglo amare jakha’?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Ps 118:22-23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Togaš o Evrejska vodačija dikhena sine sar te astaren e Isuse, soske džange deka adaja parabola vakerdi tani protiv lende, ama ola darandile e narodostar. Mukhle le hem gele peske.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo platibe danok e Cezareske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Palo adava o Evrejska vodačija bičhalge nesave farisejen hem e Irodeskere manušen te šaj te astaren e Isuse ko lafi.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Ola ale uza leste hem phenge: “Učitele, džanaja deka vakereja o čačipe hem na ikereja nikaskiri strana, soske na dikheja koj tano koj, nego čače sikaveja o drumo e Devleskoro. Trebela li te da e Cezareske o danok ili na? Te da ili na?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />A o Isus džangja deka tane dujmujale, i phengja lenge: “Soske mangena te mestinen man? Anen mange jekh dinari te dikhav.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Ola ange leske o dinari, a ov pučlja len: “Kaskiri slika hem kaskoro anav tano ko dinari?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Ola phenge: “E Cezareskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge: “Adava soj e Cezareskoro, den le e Cezareske, a adava soj e Devleskoro, den le e Devleske.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Hem ola čudinena pe sine taro leskere lafija.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo uštibe taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Togaš ale o sadukeja, so vakerena sine deka nane uštibe taro mule, i pučle e Isuse: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Učitele, o Mojsej pišingja amenge, ako mulo jekh manuš hem mukhla pala peste romni bizo čhave, leskoro phral trebela te le pe bojra romnake, te šaj oj te bijanel čhave so ka ovel nasledniko e muleskoro.<verse eid="MRK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Sine efta phrajla. O prvo lela romni hem mulo, a pala peste na mukhla čhaven. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />O dujto phral lela pe phraleskere romna, hem ov da mulo, a pala peste na mukhla čhaven. Hem agjar ulo e tritone phraleja. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />I agjar kerge sa o efta phrajla, na mukhle pala peste čhaven. Palo adava muli i romni da. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Koga ka uštel pe taro mule, kaskiri romni ka ovel oj, a sa o phrajla ikerge la?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Hovavdilen, soske na džanena o Sveto Lil hem i sila e Devleskiri. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Koga ka ušten taro mule, o manuša nane te len pe, nego ka oven sar angejla ko nebo. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />A bašo uštibe taro mule, na čitingjen li ko Lil e Mojsijaskoro, so pišinela sine baši grmuška so thablola sine, kote o Devel phengja e Mojsijaske: ‘Me sijum o Devel e Avraameskoro, e Isakoskoro hem e Jakoveskoro?’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ov nane Devel e mulengoro, nego e dživdengoro. But hovavdilen.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I najbari zapoved</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Togaš alo jekh taro učitejla e Zakoneskere hem šungja len sar kerena lafi. Dikhla deka o Isus šukar odgovorinela lenge, i pučlja le: “Koja tani i najbari zapoved taro sa o zapovedija?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Akaja tani i najbari:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:29" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:29">‘Šun, Izraele! O Gospodari, amaro Devel, tano jekh Gospodari!<verse eid="MRK 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mang te Gospodare te Devle sa te srceja, sa te dušaja, sa te gogjaja hem sa te silaja.’<verse eid="MRK 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />A i dujto tani:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:31">‘Mang te pašutne sar tut so mangeja.’</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:31">Nane pobare zapovedija akalendar.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />O učiteli e Zakoneskoro vakergja: “Šukar vakergjan učitele. Ko pravo sijan so pheneja deka jekh i o Devel hem nane javer sar leste. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Te mange le sa te srceja, sa te gogjaja hem sa te silaja, hem te mange te pašutne sar tut so mangeja, tano považno taro sa o žrtve sepalenice hem taro sa o javera žrtve.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Koga dikhla o Isus deka šukar odgovorinela, vakergja leske: “Na sijan dur taro carstvo e Devleskoro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Palo adava nikoj više na alo te pučel le.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pučibe bašo Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Dži kote o Isus sikavela sine e manušen ko Hrami pučlja len: “Soske o učitejla e Zakoneskere vakerena deka o Hristos tano e Davideskoro čhavo? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Adaleske so korkori o David preku o Sveti Duh vakergja:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 12:36" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘O Gospodari phengja me Gospodareske:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Beš tari mi desno strana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">dži kote na čhivava te dušmanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">telo te pre.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Korkori o David vikingja le ‘Gospode’ sar šaj togaš o Hristos te ovel leskoro čhavo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">A but džene šunena le sine kjefeja.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo učitejla e Zakoneskere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Dži kote sikavela len sine, o Isus vakergja: “Pazinen tumen taro učitejla e Zakoneskere. Ola mangena te phiren uravde ko skupo šeja, hem te pozdravinen len o manuša ko pazari. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Mangena te bešen ko prva thana ko sinagoge hem ko najšukar thana ko hajbe pijbe. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ola hana o barvalipe e udovicengoro hem molinena pe bare molitve. Akala manuša ka oven but silno kaznime.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I čoroli udovica dengja najviše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Palo adava o Isus bešla karši hem dikhela sine o narodo sar mukhena pare ki kasa e Hrameskiri. I but barvale manuša mukhena sine but pare. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Ama jekh čoroli udovica ali hem mukhla duj bakarna pare, so vredinena sine but hari.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Togaš o Isus vikingja pe učenikon hem phengja lenge: “Čače vakerava tumenge, akaja čoroli udovica mukhla sarinendar najviše. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Soske sarinen denge taro adava so isi len poviše, ama oj, koja tani čoroli, dengja sa so sine la.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">O Hrami ka ovel rušimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Koga o Isus iklola sine taro Hrami, jekh taro leskere učenikija vakergja leske: “Učitele, dikh save bara! Kozom i šuže o gradbe!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Dikheja li sa akala bare gradbe? Nijekh bar upro bar nane te ačhol akate. Sa ka oven rušime.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O znakija taro bare nevojle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Dži kote bešela sine o Isus ki Maslinovo Gora pe učenikoncar, karši o Hrami, o Petar, o Jakov, o Jovan hem o Andrej, ale korkori ki leste, hem pučle le: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Vaker amenge, koga ka ovel sa akava? Hem savo ka ovel o znako bašo sa akava te phergjol?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />O Isus odgovoringja: “Pazinen, ma te hovavel tumen nekoj. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Soske but džene ka aven ko mo anav, hem ka vakeren: ‘Me sijum o Hristos,’ hem ka hovaven buten. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Koga ka šunen deka isi vojne hem glasija taro maribe, ma daran. Soske sa adava mora te ovel, ama panda nane o krajo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ka ušten nacija protiv nacija, hem carstvo protiv carstvo. Ka oven zemijotresija ko but thana, hem bokhalipe. Akavaj samo o početok taro bijanibaskere dukha.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Arakhen tumen! Soske ka predajnen tumen ko sudo hem ka kamšikujnen tumen ko sinagoge. Ka tergjoven anglo vlastija hem cajra baši mange, sar svedokija lenge. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />A ko sa o nacije najanglal mora te propovedinel pe o evangelije. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Koga ka astaren te legaren tumen ko sudije, ma sekirinen tumen angleder so ka vakeren. Samo vakeren so ka del pe tumenge ko adava sati, soske nane tumen te vakeren, nego o Sveti Duh.<verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />O phral pe phrale ka predajnel ko meriba, a o dad pe čhave. O čhave ka oven protiv pumare roditejla, hem ka predajnen len ko meriba. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Sarine ka mrzinen tumen baši mange, ama adava so ka ačhol dži ko krajo ka ovel spasimo.”<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I bari bejla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Koga ka dikhen ‘o gadno so uništinela sa’ sar tergjola kote so nane leskoro than – koj čitinela neka svatinel – togaš okola, soj tane ki Judeja, neka našen ko planine. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Koj tano ko krovi, te na hulel tele hem te khuvel ko kher te lel nešto andral! <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />A koj tano ki niva te na iranel pe khere te le pe šeja! <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ama pharo ka ovel ko adala dive e khamne romnenge hem adalenge so dena thud! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Molinen tumaro našiba te na ovel ko jeven, <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />soske ko adala dive ka ovel but pharipe, sar dži akana so na sine taro početok, koga o Devel kergja o sveto, hem nikat poviše nane te ovel isto.<verse eid="MRK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ako o Gospodari na čhinagja adala dive, nikoj našti sine te ovel spasimo. Ama, bašo o birime, so biringja len, čhinagja adala dive. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Togaš ako nekoj vakergja tumenge: ‘Akje, o Hristos akate tano!’ ili: ‘Akje, okote tano!’ ma verujnen len. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Soske ka pojavinen pe hovavne hristosija hem hovavne prorokija, so ka keren znakija hem čudija te hovaven, ako šaj, adalen da soj birime taro Devel. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Adaleske pazinen tumen. Akje, vakergjum tumenge sa angleder.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O ajbe e Isuseskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Ama ko adala dive, palo adala muke:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 13:24" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">‘O kham ka temningjovel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">hem i mesečina nane te del pi svetlina;<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />o čerenja ka peren taro nebo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">hem o nebesna sile ka oven potresime.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Hem togaš o manuša ka dikhen o Čhavo Manušeskoro, sar avela upro oblakija bare silaja hem slavaja. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Togaš ka bičhavel pe angelen hem ka khedel pe birime taro štar strane e svetoskere, taro krajo e phuvijakoro dži ko krajo e neboskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I sporedba e smokvaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“A tari smokva sikloven sar te sporedinen: Koga lakere granke ka oven kovle hem ka iklon listija, džanen o nilaj tano paše. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Hem agjar tumen, koga ka dikhen deka sa adava ovela, džanen deka o vreme tano paše, anglo udar! <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Čače vakerava tumenge: Akaja generacija nane te nakhel dži kote sa akava na ovela. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />O nebo hem i phuv ka nakhen, ama me lafija nikat nane te nakhen.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O dive hem o sati nikoj na džanela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Ama bašo adava dive hem sati nikoj na džanela, ni o angejla soj ko nebo, ni o Čhavo – samo o Dad. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Oven džangavde hem arakhen tumen! Soske na džanena koga ka avel adava sati. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Adavaj sar jekh manuš, koga džala ko drumo, hem mukhela po kher: dela vlast pe slugjenge, hem dela sekaske buti, hem naredinela okoleske soj ko udar te ovel džangavdo hem te pazinel. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Adaleske oven džangavde, soske na džanena koga ka iranel pe o gospodari e khereskoro, dali rakjate, ili ki ekvaš rat, ili koga o bašne ka gilaven, ili sabajleja. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Te na avel ov taro jekh puti, hem te arakhel tumen sar sovena.<verse eid="MRK 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Akava so vakerava tumenge, vakerava sarinenge: Oven džangavde!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">O Evrejska vodačija rodena te mudaren e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Angleder duj dive pred te ovel i Pasha hem o prazniko e Beskvasno Mareskoro, o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere rodena sine sar te astaren e Isuse ko hovajbe te šaj te mudaren le. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ama phenge: “Na ko akava baro prazniko, te na buninen pe o narodo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro pomazanie ki Vitanija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />A koga sine o Isus ki Vitanija, ko kher e Simoneskoro o Leprozno. Dži kote bešela sine ki sofra, ali jekh romni so sine la šiši kerdo taro mermeri, a andre ki leste sine skupo mirizlivo ujle taro čisto nard. Oj phragja o šiši hem čhorgja o ujle upro leskoro šero.<verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Nesave manuša so sine adathe holange, hem vakerge jekh jekheske: “Soske agjar bezveze čhorela pe o skupo ujle? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Adava šaj sine te bikinel pe baši jekhe beršeskiri plata, hem o pare te del pe e čorolenge.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:5">Hem počminge te zaptinen la.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ama o Isus phengja lenge: “Mukhen la! Soske zakačinena la? Oj kergja mange šukaripe. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />O čorole manuša sekat ka oven uza tumende hem šaj te pomožinen len koga mangena, ama me nane te ovav sekat tumencar. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Oj kergja adava so šaj sine te kerel. Angleder makhla mo telo hem spremingja le bašo parujbe. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Čače vakerava tumenge, kote i te propovedinel pe o evangelije ko celo sveto, ka vakerel pe adava so kergja, te šaj sarine setinena pe ki late.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Juda dogovorinela pe te predajnel e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Togaš o Juda Iskariot, jekh taro dešuduj, gelo ko prvosveštenikija te predajnel e Isuse. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Koga ola šunge adava, radujnge pe hem denge le lafi deka ka den le pare. A ov rodela sine šužo momenti te predajnel e Isuse.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O spremiba baši Pasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ko prvo dive taro prazniko e Beskvasno Mareskoro, koga čhinena e bakhre baši Pasha, o učenikija pučle e Isuse: “Kaj mangeja te dža hem te kera tuke te ha o hajbe baši Pasha?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Togaš o Isus bičhalgja pe duje učenikon vakerindor: “Džan ko gradi, hem ka arakhen jekhe manuše so phiravela pani ko bukali. Džan pala leste. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Hem ko kova kher ka khuvel, vakeren e gazdaske: ‘O učiteli pučela ki savi soba ka hal pe učenikoncar o hajbe baši Pasha.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ov ka sikavel tumenge i bari upruni soba soj više spremimi. Adathe keren amenge o hajbe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />O učenikija gele ko gradi hem arakhle sa so phengja lenge o Isus. I adathe spreminge o hajbe e Pashakoro.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jekh taro dešuduj ka predajnel e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Koga rakjilo, o Isus gelo adathe pe dešuduje učenikoncar.<verse eid="MRK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Dži kote hana sine ki sofra, o Isus phengja lenge: “Čače vakerava tumenge, jekh tumendar, so hala mancar, ka predajnel man.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Ola but razočarisalile, hem počminge te pučen le jekh po jekh: “Te na sijum me adava?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Jekh tumendar taro dešuduj, so bolela mancar ki činija, ov tano. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Adaleske so o Čhavo Manušeskoro mora te merel sar soj pišimo, ama but pharo adale manušeske so ka predajnel le! Pošukar ka ovel sine leske te na bijangjovel.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I posledno večera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Dži kote hana sine, o Isus lela o maro, blagodaringja, phagla le hem dengja pe učenikonge, i vakergja: “Len, akavaj mo telo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Togaš lela i čaša, blagodaringja hem dengja len, i sarinen pile latar.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Hem phengja lenge: “Akavaj mo rat e zaveteskoro, so čhorgjola bute dženenge. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Čače vakerava tumenge: nane te pijav više mol, sa dži ko adava dive koga ka pijav i nevi mol ko carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Palo adava gilage gili hem gele ki Maslinovo Gora.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar ka otkažinel pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />O Isus phengja lenge: “Sarinen ka ciden tumen mandar, soske i pišimo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MRK 14:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‘Ka mudarav e pastire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">hem o bakhre ka našen.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zah 13:7</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ama palo adava, koga ka uštav taro mule, ka džav angleder tumende ki Galileja.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />A o Petar vakergja leske: “I sarinen te cidinge pe, me nane te cidav man tutar!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />O Isus phengja leske: “Čače vakerava tuke, deka tu avdive ki akaja rat, angleder o bašno te gilavel duj puti, tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ama o Petar uporno vakerela sine: “Ako trebela ka merav tuja, ama nikat nane te kerav adava!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Hem isto agjar vakerge sa o učenikija.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskiri molitva ki Getsimanija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Togaš gele ko jekh than so vikinela pe sine Getsimanija. I o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Bešen akate dži kote molinava man.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Lela peja e Petare, e Jakove hem e Jovane, hem počmingja te ovel le baro nemir hem pharipe. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Hem phengja lenge: “Doborom mange pharo so osetinava deka mi duša ka phajrol! Ačhoven akate, hem oven džangavde.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Gelo hari podur, pelo ki phuv hem molingja pe te šaj, te cidel lestar o pharo sati so adžikerela le.<verse eid="MRK 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Hem phengja: “Abba! Dade! Tu šaj sa. Cide mandar akaja čaša e pharipaja. Ama neka ovel ti vojla, a na mli.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Togaš irangja pe ko učenikija hem arakhla len sar sovena. I phengja e Petareske: “Simone, soveja li? Našti li sine jekh sati te ove džangavdo? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Oven džangavde hem molinen tumen te na peren ko iskušenie. O duho mangela te kerel adava soj šukar, ama o telo tano slabo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />I palem gelo hem molingja pe, hem vakergja ista lafija. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Koga irangja pe, palem arakhla len sar sovena soske lengere jakha phandlona sine, hem na džanena sine so te vakeren leske.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Koga irangja pe o trito puti, phengja lenge: “Panda li sovena hem odmorinena? Dosta više! Alo o sati! Akje, o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel predajmo ko vasta e grešnikonge. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ušten te dža! Akje, paše tano mo predavniko!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro astariba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Dži kote o Isus kerela sine lafi, resla o Juda, jekh taro dešuduj. A leja sine bari gužva čhurikhencar hem kaštencar, bičhavde taro prvosveštenikija, taro starešine hem taro učitejla e Zakoneskere. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />A o Juda, o predavniko e Isuseskoro, angleder dengja len znako: “Kas ka čuminav – ov tano. Astaren le hem legaren le pohari pazlivo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Samo so alo uza ko Isus, vakergja: “Učitele!” hem čumingja le ki čham.<verse eid="MRK 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />I o manuša čhige pe vasta upro leste hem astarge le. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Togaš jekh taro učenikija so sine adathe ikalgja čhurik hem khugja e bare sveštenikoskere sluga hem čhingja o kan leskoro.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />A o Isus vakergja lenge: “Sar buntovnikoske ko than alen čhurikencar hem kaštencar te astaren man? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Sekova dive sijum sine tumencar ko Hrami hem sikavava sine e manušen, a tumen na astargjen man. Ama neka ovel agjar sar soj pišimo ko Sveta Lila.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Togaš sa o učenikija mukhle le hem našle.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />A pala leste džala sine jekh terno manuš so sine učhardo upro nango telo laneno čaršafi. Le da astarge, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ama ov togaš mukhla o čaršafi hem nango našla lendar.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Evrejsko Sovet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />I ange e Isuse ko baro svešteniko, hem khedinge pe sa o prvosveštenikija, o starešine hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />A o Petar duraldan džala sine palo Isus, sa dži ko dvoro e bare sveštenikoskoro, hem adathe bešla e čuvarencar hem takjola sine uzi jag.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />A o prvosveštenikija hem o Evrejsko Sovet rodena sine nesavo dokaz te arakhen te šaj te mudaren e Isuse, ama našti sine te arakhen. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Adaleske so but džene vakerena sine hovajbe protiv leste, ama lengoro svedoštvo na sine isto.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Togaš nesave svedokija uštinge hem hovajbe svedočinge protiv leste vakerindor: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Šungjem le sar vakerela: ‘Ka peravav akava Hrami, soj kerdo manušikane vastencar, hem trine divenge ka vazdav javer, so nane te ovel kerdo manušikane vastencar.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 14:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ama ni lengoro svedoštvo na sine isto.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Togaš uštilo o baro svešteniko, terdilo maškar lende hem pučlja e Isuse: “Nane li tut so te phene ko akava, so vakerena protiv tute?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ama o Isus kjutingja hem ništo na vakergja.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Togaš o baro svešteniko pučlja le: “Tu li sijan o Hristos, o Čhavo e Blagoslovimeskoro?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />O Isus vakergja: “Me sijum, hem ka dikhen o Čhavo Manušeskoro sar bešela tari desno strana e Najsilnoskiri hem sar avela upro oblakija e neboskere.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Togaš o baro svešteniko tari holi pharagja pe šeja hem vakergja: “Na trebela amen više svedokija! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Šungjen sar hulingja upro Devel! So mislinena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Hem sarinen osudinge le deka zaslužinela te merel.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Togaš nesave manuša počminge te čhungaren le, te phanden leskere jakha hem te khuven le boksencar, i vakerge: “Prorokujn! [Koj khugja tut?]”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:65">A o čuvajra počminge te maren e Isuse.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar otkažinela pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Dži kote sine o Petar tele ko dvoro, ali jekh taro sluginke e bare sveštenikoskiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Koga dikhla e Petare sar takjola ki jag, dikhla le šukar hem phengja: “Tu da sijan sine e Isuseja taro Nazaret!”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />O Petar otkažisalilo vakerindor: “Na džanava ni na svatinava so pheneja!” Hem iklilo avrijal taro dvoro, a o bašno gilagja.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />I slugjinka koga dikhla le palem, počmingja te vakerel e manušenge so sine adathe: “Akava da tano lendar.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />A o Petar palem vakergja deka nane lendar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Na nakhla but palo adava, okola so sine adathe phenge e Petareske: “Tu čače sijan jekh lendar, soske tu da kereja lafi sar Galilejco.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />A ov počmingja te del pe armanja hem te hal sovli: “Na pendžarava akale manuše, kastar so tumen vakerena!”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />I odma o dujto puti gilagja o bašno. Togaš o Petar setingja pe ko lafija e Isuseskere so phengja leske: “Angleder o bašno te gilavel duj puti, tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.” I ov počmingja silno te rovel.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Rano sabajleja o prvosveštenikija, o starešine, o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem celo Evrejsko Sovet kerge pumaro plani. I phandle e Isuse, legarge le hem denge le ko Pilat.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />I o Pilat pučlja le: “Tu li sijan o caro e Evrejengoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Adava tu pheneja.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />A o prvosveštenikija kerge le krivo bute bukjenge.<verse eid="MRK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />O Pilat palem pučlja le: “Nane li te odgovorine ništo? Dikh kozome bukjenge kerena tut krivo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ama o Isus ništo na odgovoringja, a o Pilat čudinela pe sine.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />O Pilat ki sekoja Pasha sine le adeti te oslobodinel po jekh zatvoreniko, so o narodo ka roden lestar. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />I sine jekh manuš so vikinela pe sine Varnava, so sine ko zatvor javere tepačencar, so ki jekh buna kergja mudariba. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Hem i bari gužva ali te rodel taro Pilat te kerel lenge adava so kerela le sine stalno.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />A o Pilat pučlja len: “Mangena li te oslobodinav tumenge e Evrejsko care?”<verse eid="MRK 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Adaleske so ov džanela sine deka o prvosveštenikija predajnge e Isuse tari ljubomora.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ama o prvosveštenikija pherge e narodo te roden e Pilatestar te oslobodinel lenge e Varnava.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />A o Pilat palem pučlja len: “So te kerav okoleja so vikinena le Evrejsko caro?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Ola vikinena sine: “Čhiv le ko krsto!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Togaš o Pilat pučlja: “Soske? Savo lošnipe kergja?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Ama ola panda po više vikinge: “Čhiv le ko krsto!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />A o Pilat kerindor e manušengiri vojla oslobodingja e Varnava, a e Isuse dengja te kamšikujnen le hem te čhiven le ko krsto.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O vojnikija asana e Isuseske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />I nesave vojnikija legarge e Isuse ko Pretorijum ki palata e Pilateskiri, hem vikinge celo vojska te kheden pe. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Urage le carsko mantili, pletinge kruna taro kare hem čhige la leske ko šero. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Hem počminge te vikinen: “Zdravo, Evrejsko care!”<verse eid="MRK 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />I khuvena le sine ko šero kašteja hem čhungarena le sine. Ola perena sine ko kočaka angli leste hem kerena pe sine deka slavinena le. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />A palo adava koga khelge peske leja, ikalge lestar o mantili, hem urage le leskere šeja i legarge te čhiven le ko krsto.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse čhivena ko krsto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Ko drumo nakhela sine jekh manuš so vikinela pe sine Simon tari Kirineea, o dad e Aleksandareskoro hem e Rufeskoro, so avela sine tari niva, hem čhige le te phiravel e Isuseskoro krsto. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Hem ange e Isuse ko adava than so vikinela pe Golgota – so značinela “Than e Čerepeskoro.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />I dena le sine mol mešimo smirnaja, ama ov na lela. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />I koga čhige le ko krsto, delinge leskere šeja maškar peste agjar so frdinge ždrepka te dikhen koj so ka lel.<verse eid="MRK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Koga čhige le ko krsto sine o sati enja sabajle. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />I sine pišimo natpis baši leskiri krivica:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">“O CARO E EVREJENGORO.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />A leja čhige ko krsto duje buntovnikon, jekh tari desno strana, hem jekh tari levo strana. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Hem agjar pherdilo o Sveto Lil so vakerela: “Dikhle le sar jekh kriminalco.”]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />A okola so nakhena sine, iranindor po šero uvredžinena le sine vakerindor: “Ej! Tu so peraveja o Hrami hem vazdeja le trine divenge, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />huli tele taro krsto hem spasin tut!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Isto agjar o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere asana sine maškar peste: “Javeren spasingja, a korkori pes našti te spasinel! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ako ov tano o Hristos, o caro e Izraeleskoro, neka hulel akana taro krsto, te šaj te dikha hem te verujna ki leste.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">A uvredžinena le sine okola da so sine leja ko krsto.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro meriba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />A ko dešuduj o sati temnisalilo ki celo phuv hem agjar sine trin satija. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ko trin o sati paloručko, o Isus vikingja sa pe glasoja: <char style="it">“Eloi, Eloi, lama sabahtani?”</char> (so značinela “Mo Devel, mo Devel, soske mukhlan man?”).<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Ps 22:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Koga šunge adava nesave so tergjovena sine paše, vakerge: “Šunen, ov vikinela e Ilija!”<verse eid="MRK 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Nekoj lendar prastandilo, hem topingja o sungjeri ko šut hem čhiga le ko kaš i dengja e Isuse te pijel, vakerindor: “Adžikeren! Ajde te dikha dali o Ilija ka avel te hujlarel le!”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />A o Isus vikingja sa pe glasoja, hem mukhla pi duša.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ko adava momenti i zavesa taro Hrami pharavdili ko ekvaš upral dži tele. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Koga dikhla o Rimsko kapetani so tergjola sine angli leste sar mulo o Isus, vakergja: “Čače akava manuš sine o Čhavo e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />A adathe sine nesave romnja so dikhle duraldan. Maškar lende sine i Marija tari Magdala, hem Marija i daj e poterne Jakoveskiri hem e Josifeskiri, hem i Salomija. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Ola džana sine palo Isus hem pomožinena le sine ki Galileja, a adathe sine panda but romnja so ale leja ko Erusalim.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro parujba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Adava sine Dive bašo Spremiba, o dive angleder i sabota. Adaleske koga počmingja te rakjol, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />o Josif tari Arimateja, so sine poštojmo členi ko Sovet e Evrejengoro, koj korkori adžikerela sine o carstvo e Devleskoro, bizo dar gelo ko Pilat hem rodingja o telo e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />O Pilat čudisalilo so šungja deka mulo više o Isus. I vikingja e Rimsko kapetane hem pučlja le, dali čače mulo o Isus. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Koga šungja lendar adava, o Pilat dozvolingja te lel o telo leskoro o Josif. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />O Josif kingja laneno čaršafi, hujlargja o telo e Isuseskoro, pakjargja le ko čaršafi hem čhigja le ko grobo, so sine kerdi dupka ki karpa. Hem guringja baro bar ko udara taro grobo. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />I Marija tari Magdala hem i Marija e Josifeskiri daj, dikhena sine kaj čhivela leskoro telo.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus uštilo taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Koga nakhla i sabota, i Marija tari Magdala, i Marija e Jakoveskiri daj hem i Saloma kinge mirisija te šaj te džan te makhen o telo e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Rano sabajle ko prvo dive taro kurko, koga o kham iklilo, gele ko grobo.<verse eid="MRK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Hem drumaldan pučena pe sine: “Koj ka cidel amenge o bar taro udar e groboskoro?”<verse eid="MRK 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ama koga resle, dikhle deka o bar sine cidimo. A adava sine čače baro bar. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Koga khuge ko grobo, dikhle jekhe terne manuše ko parne šeja sar bešela tari desno strana, a ola darandile.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />I ov phengja lenge: “Ma daran! Tumen rodena e Isuse taro Nazaret, so mulo ko krsto. Ov uštilo taro mule hem nane akate! Akje dikhen o than kaj so pašlilo. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Nego džan hem vakeren leskere učenikonge hem e Petareske: ‘Ov džala angleder tumendar ki Galileja. Adathe ka dikhen le, sar so angleder phengja tumenge.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />O džuvla sine but bunime hem lele te tresinen, i našle taro grobo. Nikaske ništo na vakerge, soske darandile.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pe ko but thana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />[Rano sabajle ko prvo dive taro kurko, koga o Isus uštilo taro mule, prvo sikavgja pe e Marijake tari Magdala, so latar angleder ikalgja efta demonen. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Oj geli hem vakergja adava okolenge so sine leja, so tugujnena sine hem rovena. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Koga šunge ola deka o Isus dživdo hem deka oj dikhla le, na verujnge la.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Palo adava o Isus sikavgja pe ko javer izgled pe duje učenikonge, sar džana sine ko jekh gav. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Ola irange pe hem vakerge e javere učenikonge, ama ni len da na verujnge.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Palo adava, o Isus sikavgja pe e dešujekhe učenikonge sar hana sine maro zaedno. I opomeningja len so na sine len vera hem soj lengere vile barale, soske na verujnge okolen so dikhle le deka uštilo taro mule.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Hem phengja lenge: “Džan ko celo sveto hem propovedinen o evangelije sa e manušenge. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Koj ka verujnel hem ka ovel krstimo, ka ovel spasimo, ama koj na verujnela, ka ovel osudimo. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />A akala znakija ka oven adalencar so ka verujnen: Ko mo anav ka ikalen demonen; ka keren lafi ko neve čhibja; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />te astarge sapa pe vastencar hem te pile nešto otrovno, nane te ovel lenge ništo; ka čhiven pumare vasta upro nasvale hem ola ka sasljoven.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus voznesinela pe ko nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Koga phengja akava, o Gospodari o Isus voznesisalilo ko nebo hem bešla tari desno strana e Devleskiri.<verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Hem o učenikija gele ko sa o thana te propovedinen, a o Gospodari kerela sine buti lencar adaleja so potvrdinela sine leskoro lafi e znakoncar.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>